ychologiquement, cette séance est généralement ressourçante alors profitez-en !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":327,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"SL_135","description":"Sortie longue à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale, comme pour les footings.","displayName":"Sortie Longue","coachAdvice":"Comment évaluer la progression de ton endurance et de ta capacité à durer en trail ? Avec ce type de sortie longue de 2h15 !\nAu fil des semaines, tu dois sentir que tu es capable d'aller de plus en plus loin dans la sortie sans ressentir davantage de fatigue… et c'est exactement l'objectif. Plus tu avances dans le plan, plus ces longues sorties doivent te sembler maîtrisées, signe que ton endurance se développe dans la bonne direction.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"trail_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_135","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":327,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":135,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status